== f unprivileged vs privileged capability checklist
read own /proc/self/stat                             OK (unprivileged)
read other uid 0 process /proc/1/stat                OK (unprivileged)
read /proc/1/cmdline                                 OK (unprivileged)
inotify watch own dir                                OK (unprivileged)
bind AF_UNIX socket in tmp                           OK (unprivileged)
sqlite write in own dir                              OK (unprivileged)
watch /root (other uid dir)                          DENIED
read /etc/shadow                                     DENIED
btrfs subvolume snapshot /                           DENIED
mount tmpfs                                          DENIED
